metapolicy_extra_info:
Front desk is open 24/7.
The hotel prohibits:
— bringing food with a strong smell into the room (such as seafood, durian, jackfruit, pickled vegetables, etc.);
— smoking in the room;
— hanging clothes on the balcony or in the room.
In case of violation of any of the rules, a fine of VND 5000000.00 will be charged for each case.

Russian citizens must have an original Russian passport upon arrival.
There is a possibility of remote settlement.
Early check-in and late check-out are discussed in advance and paid separately in the amount of RUB 1000.00 per hour, subject to free deadline dates.
Upon check-in, a rental agreement is signed.
The deposit on the house returned on the day of departure minus cleaning costs and subject to the safety of the property.
Prices are for 2 people. Additional guest — RUB 500.00.
Prices may vary depending on seasonality and holidays.
Long-term rentals may differ from short-term rentals. Contact details can be found on the booking confirmation.
You can't stay in the house:
- carelessly treat the house, plot, property;
- smoking in the house;
- check in with a larger number of guests than agreed;
- make noise on the street from 01:00 PM to 03:00 PM and from 09:00 PM to 08:00 AM;
- use pyrotechnics, build a fire outside the fire zone;
- walk around the house in street shoes and heels.
Modern wood-fired sauna with a panoramic window overlooking the forest. The cost of visiting the sauna is RUB 3000.00 per day. Firewood is included in the price.
